'''Game progression''' refers to the state in which a save file is in. This varies greatly between every savefile, and has many different stages as secrets are unlocked. In order to make progression, it is necessary to unlock various characters and chapters. On this page, the unlock requirements for these steps in progression are listed in order of rough availability.

== Major Chapter Unlocks ==
=== {{s|Womb}} ===
An entrance to {{s|Womb}} is unlocked by beating {{e|Mom}} 1 time.

This entrance will spawn after beating {{e|Mom}} on every subsequent run.

* It is possible to reach {{s|Womb}} alternatively via a trapdoor generated by {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} or {{p|Ehwaz}}.

=== {{s|Sheol}} and {{s|Cathedral}} ===
Entrances to {{s|Sheol}} and {{s|Cathedral}} are unlocked by beating {{e|Mom's Heart}} 11 times.

These entrances will spawn after beating {{e|It Lives!}}, which replaces {{e|Mom's Heart}} on every subsequent run.

{{dlc+|a}} The entrances will also spawn after beating {{e|Hush}}.{{dlc-}}

* It is possible to reach {{s|Sheol}} alternatively via a trapdoor generated by {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} or {{p|Ehwaz}} on Womb II, or through a trapdoor which spawns in the {{r|Devil Room}} on Womb II.
* It is possible to reach {{s|Cathedral}} alternatively via a beam of light which spawns in the {{r|Angel Room}} on Womb II.

=== {{s|Dark Room}} and {{s|Chest}} ===
The player will transport to {{s|Dark Room}} when entering the chest spawned by {{e|Satan}} so long as the player holds {{i|The Negative}}.

The player will transport to {{s|Chest}} when entering the chest spawned by {{e|Isaac}} so long as the player holds {{i|The Polaroid}}.

{{i|The Negative}} is unlocked by beating {{e|Satan}} 5 times.

{{i|The Polaroid}} is unlocked by beating {{e|Isaac}} 5 times.

Once unlocked {{i|The Negative}} and/or {{i|The Polaroid}} will always spawn after beating {{e|Mom}} (but only one can be taken).

* It is possible to enter {{s|Dark Room}} alternatively by using the {{r|Sacrifice Room}} 12+ Times on any floor.

=== {{e|Mega Satan}} ===
A door to {{e|Mega Satan}} will appear at the beginning of {{s|Dark Room}} and {{s|Chest}} once {{e|???}} or {{e|The Lamb}} has been beaten once.

This door can be opened by collecting {{i|Key Piece 1}} and {{i| Key Piece 2}}, by using {{i|Dad's Key}}, {{p|Get out of Jail Free Card|n}}, or {{p|Soul of Cain|n}}, using {{i|Sharp Key|n}} or {{i|Mr. ME!|n}} on the door, or taking damage while having {{i|Cracked Orb|n}}.

It is possible to obtain {{i|Key Piece 1}} and {{i| Key Piece 2}} by bombing the angel statues inside of {{r|Angel Room}}s and defeating the angel spawned.
Alternatively these angels will spawn when using the {{r|Sacrifice Room}}.

* Note: It is possible to obtain both {{i|Key Piece 1}} and {{i| Key Piece 2}} before unlocking {{a|Angels}}; however the door to {{e|Mega Satan}} will not appear until the achievement is unlocked.

=== {{dlc+|a}} {{s|???}} ===
A door to {{s|???}} is unlocked by beating {{e|Mom's Heart}} 10 times.

This door will spawn after beating {{e|It Lives!}} in under 30 minutes on any subsequent run.
{{dlc-}}

=== {{dlc+|a+}} {{s|The Void}} ===
A door to {{s|The Void}} is unlocked by beating {{e|Hush}} 1 time.

This door will spawn after beating {{e|Hush}} on any subsequent run.

A portal to {{s|The Void}} will also have a chance to spawn after most major bosses on any subsequent run.

{{dlc|r+}} The portal is guaranteed to spawn after beating {{e|???}}, {{e|The Lamb}}, {{e|Mega Satan}}, and {{e|Mother|n}} (only if you have beaten her before with the character you're playing with).
{{dlc-}}

=== {{dlc+|r}} Alternate Floors ===
Doors to {{s|Downpour}}, {{s|Mines}}, {{s|Mausoleum}} and {{s|Corpse}} will unlock by beating {{e|Hush}} 3 times.

These doors will spawn in the {{r|Boss Room}} once the boss is defeated on chapters I, II, and III on subsequent runs.

* See {{i|Knife Piece 1}} and {{i|Knife Piece 2}} on how to access {{s|Corpse}}.
{{dlc-}}

=== {{dlc+|r}} [[Ascent]] and {{s|Home}} ===
A door to a special version of {{s|Mausoleum}} will appear at the beginning of Depths II on every subsequent run once {{e|Mother}} has been beaten 1 time.

This door can be opened by interacting with it, by using either {{i|The Negative}} or {{i|The Polaroid}}.

It can also be opened with {{T|Faded Polaroid}}  and {{i|Dad's Key}}.

This can be done using any form of teleporting (e.g. {{I|Teleport!}}) after beating {{e|Mom}}. (a [[File:Tinted Skull.png|frameless|33x33px]] marked skull (see [[Rocks]]) on the floor will always contain a {{p|0 - The Fool}}) card
{{dlc-}}

* Although difficult to achieve under normal circumstances, if Isaac uses {{I|Glowing Hourglass|n}} in the starting room ''without entering any other rooms'', he will instantly warp to {{s|Home|n}}, skipping the Ascent. This works regardless of if {{e|Mother|n}} has been defeated or not, meaning that it's theoretically possible to reach {{s|Home|n}} without even killing {{e|Mom}} once.
** This can be done through various means. {{c|Eden}} can start with {{I|Glowing Hourglass|n}}, and use it as soon as the first room. If Isaac has {{i|Schoolbag|n}}, {{i|R Key|n}}, and {{i|Glowing Hourglass|n}}, using {{i|R Key|n}} and then {{i|Glowing Hourglass|n}} in succession will warp Isaac to {{s|Home|n}}.

